    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a SmartTools user",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want to view HTTP Browsing, Ping and Video Streaming test results as points on a map and open a detail dialog for an individual point",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So that I can investigate the specific test result at a location.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Issue/Change Description:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Provide direct-map layers for HTTP Browsing, Ping and Video Streaming. Each result is displayed as a selectable map point."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Selecting a point opens a new point-detail dialog for that exact result. The dialog must show the test type, result time, location, available network technology/context, and the test-specific KPI:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "HTTP Browsing: Page Load Time"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Ping: Ping Time"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Video Streaming: Rebuffer Count"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "HTTP Browsing results that end in error must be visually distinct from successful Page Load Time results; a failed result with a zero Page Load Time must not be coloured as successful."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Route Replay is out of scope; it will be covered by a separate story."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dependencies: migrated Automobile map and point-detail data must provide a stable point identifier and the fields required by the dialog."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "QA: verify each test type with representative data, point-to-dialog data matching, failed HTTP result colouring, and empty/error detail responses."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance Criteria:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given HTTP Browsing, Ping, or Video Streaming data is available, when its layer is selected, then its results are displayed as points on the map."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a user clicks a result point, when point details are available, then a new dialog opens for that exact point."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given an HTTP Browsing point is selected, then the dialog displays Page Load Time with the common point context."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a Ping point is selected, then the dialog displays Ping Time with the common point context."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a Video Streaming point is selected, then the dialog displays Rebuffer Count with the common point context."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given an HTTP Browsing test ends in error, when its point is rendered, then it is visually distinct from a successful result and is not coloured as a successful Page Load Time result."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given point details cannot be returned, when a user selects a point, then the user receives a clear no-data or error message and no stale detail data is displayed."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
